# Baseline B-01 (negotiation-1; also pins F-01): a handshake that proposes
# only Bolt 4.4 is answered 00 00 04 04, and the connection then serves a
# session: HELLO succeeds (ADR-0303). The leading C: <RAW> is the script's
# own handshake, so there is no automatic one and no !: AUTO HELLO.
!: AUTO GOODBYE

C: <RAW> 60 60 B0 17 00 00 04 04 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00
S: <RAW> 00 00 04 04
C: HELLO {"user_agent": "relate-bolt-compat/1.0", "scheme": "none"}
S: SUCCESS {}
